flowchart TB
    A[Thai test source<br/>genuine or spoof] --> C0[C0: clean<br/>16 kHz PCM]
    A --> C1[C1: bandwidth control<br/>8 kHz linear PCM]
    A --> C2[C2: G.711 μ-law<br/>8 kHz round trip]
    A --> C3[C3: G.711 A-law<br/>8 kHz round trip]

    C0 --> D
    C1 --> D
    C2 --> D
    C3 --> D

    subgraph D [Frozen detector panel — capacity axis]
        direction LR
        D1[LFCC-GMM<br/>non-neural] --- D2[AASIST-L<br/>~85K] --- D3[AASIST<br/>~297K] --- D4[frozen WavLM<br/>~94M] --- D5[WavLM + LoRA<br/>~94M + adapters]
    end

    D --> E[Paired source-level scores<br/>+ measured params, MACs, latency]

    E --> F[ΔEER per detector with paired<br/>cluster-bootstrap intervals]
    E --> G[Clean-development threshold transfer<br/>FPR, FNR and balanced accuracy<br/>with no channel retuning]
    E --> H[Bandwidth versus companding<br/>decomposition from C1]
    E --> I[DiD: ΔEER small − ΔEER large<br/>range and within-family contrasts]
    E --> J[Frontier plot and<br/>on-device deployment check]

